cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "TANDEM: Training-Free Token and Precision Allocation with Device-Calibrated Cost"
abstract: >-
  Training-free token and precision allocation for fixed Vision Transformers
  using classifier-logit distortion and exact finite-surrogate search.
  A controlled comparison of analytical bit-operations and device-calibrated
  block costs on two Jetson Orin modules, with software accuracy evaluation.
  Block-sum estimates are not end-to-end classifier measurements.
authors:
  - family-names: Sarim
    given-names: Muhammad Fawad Ul Hassan
repository-code: "https://github.com/fawadsarim/tandem"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - vision-transformers
  - model-compression
  - quantization
  - token-merging
  - efficient-inference
  - edge-ai
